      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00376</html:p>
          <html:p>type: catalysis</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: In this study, we demonstrated that the Arabidopsis CYP735A1 and CYP735A2 encode CK hydroxylases that catalyze tZ biosynthesis via the iPRMP-dependent pathway. </html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
