    <glyph class="process" id="rx00433" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00433</html:p>
          <html:p>type: transcriptional/translational activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: transcription</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: The binding of TCP8 to this site was confirmed by in vitro and in vivo assays. Expression patterns of TCP8 and its corresponding gene TCP9 largely overlapped with ICS1 under pathogen attack. A significant reduction in the expression of ICS1 during immune responses was observed in the tcp8 tcp9 double mutant.</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
