          <html:p>evidence: hemical details of  IAA homeostasis.Several enzymes hydrolyse IAA–amino acid conjugates to free IAA: IAA–LEUCINE RESISTANT1 (ILR1; Bartel and Fink,  1995),  ILR1  homologues,  ILR1-LIKE1  (ILL1),  ILL2  (Bartel and Fink, 1995; LeClere et al., 2002), IAA–ALANINE RESISTANT3 (IAR3), ILL3, and ILL5 (Davies et al., 1999). </html:p>
        </html:body>
