        </annotation>
      </extension>
      <bbox x="14874.8" y="5130.6" w="20.0" h="20.0" />
      <port id="rx00457.in" x="14884.8" y="5115.6" />
      <port id="rx00457.out" x="14884.8" y="5165.6" />
    </glyph>
    <glyph class="process" id="rx00458" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00458</html:p>
          <html:p>type: catalysis</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: The AtGH3-9 gene is involved in the regulation of the primary root growth of Arabidopsis, the overexpressed strains of GH3-8 showed decreased IAA level and increased IAA-Asp level, abnormal development morphology and growth retardation.</html:p>
        </html:body>
