          <html:p>reaction: rx00504</html:p>
          <html:p>type: binding/oligomerisation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: We found that HA-CDK8 coimmunoprecipitated with TGA5-GFP and TGA7-GFP but not with the GFP control (Fig. 7B), confirming that TGA5 and TGA7 interact with CDK8 in planta.</html:p>
