          <html:p>reaction: rx00514</html:p>
          <html:p>type: catalysis</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: PBS3, a GH3 acyl adenylase-family enzyme important for SA accumulation, catalyzes ATP- and Mg2+-dependent conjugation of L-glutamate primarily to the 8-carboxyl of isochorismate and yields the key SA biosynthetic intermediate, isochorismoyl-glutamate A</html:p>
