      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00526</html:p>
          <html:p>type: transcriptional/translational activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: transcription</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Upon infection, EDS1–PAD4 complexes activate defense pathways represented by the enzymes ICS1, FMO1 and ALD1, mediating (primarily) SA-dependent, SA-independent and systemic defense responses (SAR), respectively.</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
