          <html:p>evidence: REDUCED HYPEROSMOLALITY-INDUCED [Ca2+]cyt INCREASE 1 (OSCA1), a potential osmosensor  is involved in hyperosmotic stress-induced [Ca2+]cyt increases</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
      <extension>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:sio="http://semanticscience.org/resource/">
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="#rx00568">
              <bqbiol:is>
                <rdf:Bag>
                  <rdf:li rdf:resource="http://identifiers.org/skm:rx00568" />
                </rdf:Bag>
              </bqbiol:is>
              <bqmodel:isDescribedBy>
                <rdf:Bag>
                  <rdf:li rdf:resource="http://identifiers.org/doi:10.1038/s41580-022-00479-6" />
