      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00571</html:p>
          <html:p>type: transcriptional/translational activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: transcription</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: ABF3 and ABF4 can directly induce the transcription of SUPPRESSOR OF OVEREXPRESSION OF CO 1 (SOC1), another key flowering gene</html:p>
