    </glyph>
    <glyph class="process" id="rx00580" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00580</html:p>
          <html:p>type: protein deactivation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Here, we demonstrated that recombinant Zucchini yellow mosaic virus (ZYMV) HC-Pro inhibited the methyltransferase activity of HEN1 in vitro</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
      <extension>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:sio="http://semanticscience.org/resource/">
