          <html:p>reaction: rx00591</html:p>
          <html:p>type: catalysis</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: ribonuclease type III-like enzymes named Dicer that process double-stranded RNA (dsRNA) into small RNA duplexes. In Arabidopsis, DCL2 and DCL4 process double-stranded RNA into 22 and 21 nucleotide small interfering (si)RNAs, respectively [...]. </html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
