      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00723</html:p>
          <html:p>type: catalysis</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: via coordinated activities of myo-INOSITOL KINASE (MIK) and INOSITOL-TETRAKISPHOSPHATE 5,6-KINASES (ITPKs), InsP is sequentially phosphorylated to generate InsP5</html:p>
        </html:body>
