      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00724</html:p>
          <html:p>type: catalysis</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: In Arabidopsis thaliana, a single gene-encoding  INOSITOL PENTAKISPHOSPHATE 2-KINASE (IPK1)  catalyzes the synthesis of InsP6 from InsP5</html:p>
