          <html:p>evidence: SnRK2.6-MYC was present in RAP2.6-GFP immune-complex, and RAP2.6-GFP was also pulled down by SnRK2.6-MYC. Using Y2H and BiFC assays, SnRK2.6 was demonstrated to directly interact with RAP2.6.</html:p>
