          <html:p>evidence: ADR1, ADR-L1 and ADR-L2 encode three closely related CC-NB-LRR proteins required for immunity mediated by TIR-NB-LRR R proteins RPP2 and RPP4 (ref. 35). They were also identified as candidate target genes of SARD1 by ChIP-seq (Table 1). ChIP-PCR analysis confirmed that SARD1 binds to the promoter regions of these three genes (Fig. 5d). </html:p>
