      <port id="rx00946.out" x="13391.9" y="4229.7" />
    </glyph>
    <glyph class="process" id="rx00949" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00949</html:p>
          <html:p>type: protein deactivation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: phosphorylation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Taken together, these findings indicate that CPK5 and CPK11 predominantly phosphorylate MIZ1 at Ser14 and Ser36.</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
