      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00986</html:p>
          <html:p>type: binding/oligomerisation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: we found that EDS1 could interact with the WT and cytoplasmic sim3 mutant in planta (Figure 6A) and in E. coli (Figure 6B), indicating that NPR1 recruits EDS1 into SINCs through a direct interaction. </html:p>
        </html:body>
