        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00996</html:p>
          <html:p>type: catalysis</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: In vivo labeling in petunia flower petals showed a conversion of benzaldehyde to benzyl alcohol, thus providing the other precursor needed to produce benzyl benzoate.</html:p>
