          <html:p>reaction: rx00999</html:p>
          <html:p>type: catalysis</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: The above results collectively resolved the search for the critical CYP hydroxylase in SA biosynthesis, demonstrating that benzylbenzoate, rather than BA, serves as the direct hydroxylation substrate for OsBBH in SA biosynthesis.</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
